  "releaseNotes": "RoomSharp 0.4.0 Release Notes\n\n            • Added full support for PostgreSQL, SQL Server, SQLite, and MySQL dialects.\n            • Implemented high-performance ILFactory (no boxing, no allocations, span-based mappers).\n            • Added ReaderKind mechanism for zero-overhead typed reads with dialect-aware boolean handling.\n            • Improved source-generated mappers with compile-time column mapping and setter caching.\n            • Implemented normalized column name resolution (identifier trimming + dialect-based name lookup).\n            • Added support for constructors, projections, embedded relations, and multi-table DAO generation.\n            • Improved safety checks for type mismatches, nullability, and missing column detection.\n            • Added consistent mapper cache keys based on data reader schema.\n            • Added DateTime, Guid, and numeric parsing improvements for all providers.\n            • Major performance improvements across RoomDatabase execution pipeline.\n            • Fixed numerous bugs and edge cases found in 0.3.x.\n            • Updated documentation and samples.",
